# The 22 snapshot evals of repair_pilot_tamia.cmds, for its eval_queue.sh workers:
# "<ready-file>\t<command>". Snapshots are on the node-local disk ($SLURM_TMPDIR/snaps);
# each is ready once its arm's script has written repair_done, after the replay and every
# fill. Longest arm first, since a worker takes the first ready line.
